918: \label{sec:conclusions}
919: 
920: The degree-ten graded piece of the invariant ring of the ten-dimensional
921: self-dual five-form is now known exactly, together with its product, published,
922: graph-generator and stress-flow-reachable subspaces and all their intersections.
923: Every one of those dimensions is exact over $\mathbb{Q}$, not merely modulo a
924: prime: the four spanned subspaces are pinned by counting their spanning sets, and
925: the two that are not --- the reachable subspace and the intersection of the
926: published span with the products --- were settled by exact rational computations
927: after lifting the relevant coordinates by Chinese remaindering and validating at
928: held-out primes. The quotient by the reachable subspace is
929: $\dim_{\mathbb{Q}} Q_{10} \czQtenRelation \dimQtenQ$ and has explicit
930: representatives.
931: 
932: A tempting identification between two decompositions that both read
933: $\dimBten+\dimPten$ turns out to be false, and the correct structural statement
934: is $A_{10} = G_{10}\oplus P_{10}$. The failure is concrete: the published span
935: meets the products in exactly one dimension over $\mathbb{Q}$, generated by the
936: integer identity~\eqref{eq:bpidentity}.
937: 
938: Separately, the spinor-variable description has been connected to the tensor
939: description by an explicit convention-controlled bridge, and the numerical
940: Jacobian rank computation has been replaced by an exact modular one that yields a
941: rigorous bound.
